\b PostQueue\b0\par
\par
PostQueue posts your photos and videos to Instagram on a schedule, from this computer, through Meta's official Instagram API.\par
\par
Setup takes three short steps the first time it opens: connect your Instagram professional account, connect a free media hosting account, and choose your usual posting time. After that you only drop in photos and pick a time.\par
\par
The program is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. Your Instagram and hosting accounts stay yours and are subject to their own terms. Third-party components and their licences are listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt and the licenses folder installed with the program. Instagram is a trademark of Meta Platforms, Inc.; PostQueue is not affiliated with Meta.\par
